king into thumbnail strategies, dissecting visual formulas and easy-to-use software. Further, I'm examining YouTube's algorithm behaviors for new channels, and establishing realistic expectations. Lastly, I'm researching the actual learning curve for a beginner's first video creation using the Rockstar Editor and Menyoo.\n\n\n**Defining Beginner Obstacles**\n\nI'm now zeroing in on the challenges a beginner faces, particularly the initial hurdles. I have simulated responses from sub-agents. They point to specific needs in laptops, such as at least an RTX 4060, and 32GB of RAM. They also highlighted the critical need for meticulous file management when modding GTA 5, highlighting a few specific mods. Finally, I'm identifying where to get the mods. I'm taking all this into consideration.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"invoke_subagent","args":{"Subagents":"[{\"Model\":\"inherit\",\"Prompt\":\"Research the exact minimum and recommended LAPTOP specifications for running GTA 5 with heavy mods (Menyoo, AddonPeds, graphic mods, 10+ custom ragdolls) AND recording via OBS simultaneously. Keep in mind laptops thermal throttle. What CPU/GPU/RAM combo is actually required to avoid lag and crashes? Give specific laptop model or spec recommendations for a beginner buying one today.\",\"Role\":\"Laptop Hardware Specialist\",\"TypeName\":\"research\"},{\"Model\":\"inherit\",\"Prompt\":\"Research the exact step-by-step reality of installing GTA 5 Spider-Man/superhero mods for a total beginner. Identify the required baseline tools (OpenIV, ScriptHookV, Gameconfig, HeapAdjuster, Packfile Limit Adjuster). What are the most common fatal errors (e.g., ERR_MEM_EMBEDDEDALLOC_ALLOC, infinite loading) and how must a beginner fix them to prevent the game from crashing when spawning custom models?\",\"Role\":\"Modding Architect\",\"TypeName\":\"research\"},{\"Model\":\"inherit\",\"Prompt\":\"Research exactly where creators in the GTA 5 kids niche download their custom XML Spooner maps (mega ramp