zen 7, and **32GB of RAM**. 16GB will crash when loading massive custom maps.\\n*   **The Model:** Lenovo Legion Pro 5i or ASUS ROG Strix (thick chassis for cooling). \\n*   **The Hack:** Elevate the laptop with a $20 stand so the intake fans can breathe. Never play flat on the library desk.\\n\\n### 2. The Modding Headache & Fatal Errors\\nInstalling mods is not one-click. It requires a strict order to prevent infinite loading screens.\\n*   **The Core:** `OpenIV` and `ScriptHookV`.\\n*   **The Fatal Error Fix:** If you spawn 5 Spider-Men, the game crashes with `ERR_MEM_EMBEDDEDALLOC_ALLOC`. To fix this, you MUST install **HeapAdjuster**, **Packfile Limit Adjuster**, and a **Custom Gameconfig.xml**. These force the game engine to allow more memory.\\n\\n### 3. The Asset Shopping List (Where to get the stuff)\\n*   **Sets / Mega Ramps (FREE):** `gta5-mods.com` (Maps > Ramps). Download XML files and drop them in the `MenyooStuff\\\\Spooner` folder.\\n*   **Marvel Costumes (FREE):** `gta5-mods.com`. Use the `AddonPeds` tool to inject them.\\n*   **Superpowers (PAID/FREE):** **JulioNIB**. His newest, crash-free power scripts (web swinging, lasers) are on his Patreon ($2-$5/month). Older versions are free on his blog.\\n\\n### 4. The 1-2 Hour Production Loophole\\nContent farms do not spend 8 hours making a video. They use these speed hacks:\\n*   **XML Templates:** They don't build sets; they load pre-built Menyoo XML maps in\n<truncated 4633 bytes>","Description":"\"Compiled the 6-agent deep research on the GTA kids niche and mapped it directly to the user's existing Stickman workflow, identifying which tools to keep and which to drop.\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\renu5\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\efc75235-355e-455c-b598-1a3e644f6697\\\\gta_kids_niche_master_guide.md\"","toolAction":"\"Writing master workflow guide\"","toolSummary":"\"Create Master Guide MD\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
